{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411310","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411310","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1241131001:1":{"text":"你们知道，之前的绿水村是什么样的吗？","source_cn":"你们知道，之前的绿水村是什么样的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE542ACF611CA3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1241131001":{"text":"你们知道，之前的绿水村是什么样的吗？","source_cn":"你们知道，之前的绿水村是什么样的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE542ACF611CA3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241131002:1":{"text":"之前的绿水村是非常富饶的村庄。","source_cn":"之前的绿水村是非常富饶的村庄。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11EA49B7F97CE63F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241131003:1":{"text":"这里的海域水很清澈，盛产一种叫<style=\"highlight\">银浪鱼</style>的海产。","source_cn":"这里的海域水很清澈，盛产一种叫<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x107118EEAB118842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241131004:1":{"text":"这种鱼因为味美，耐长途运输，产量大，被从锈锚港销往很多地方。","source_cn":"这种鱼因为味美，耐长途运输，产量大，被从锈锚港销往很多地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD349CDFFC9DBB29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241131005:1":{"text":"那时候，一艘又一艘装着鱼获的船驶出锈锚港，返航时则带回远方的香料，布匹，还有各式各样的种子。","source_cn":"那时候，一艘又一艘装着鱼获的船驶出锈锚港，返航时则带回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB816FB93E446A09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241131006:1":{"text":"原来锈锚港以前这么繁荣，但现在港口冷清得连个人都没有……","source_cn":"原来锈锚港以前这么繁荣，但现在港口冷清得连个人都没有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30FA4705EFF3AD50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241131007:1":{"text":"现在这个村子让人完全联想不到富饶……","source_cn":"现在这个村子让人完全联想不到富饶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2C51B34299C839A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241131008:1":{"text":"这里传出闹鬼的传闻后，我派人来这里探查过，但一无所获。","source_cn":"这里传出闹鬼的传闻后，我派人来这里探查过，但一无所获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BE7C329D5B3B424","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241131009:1":{"text":"甚至我派的人，都没有回来。","source_cn":"甚至我派的人，都没有回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA39CC6DD640D1EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1241131009":{"text":"甚至我派的人，都没有回来。","source_cn":"甚至我派的人，都没有回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA39CC6DD640D1EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241131010:1":{"text":"一个喝醉的渔民说的，说雾气里有尖声怪叫，鬼影幢幢。","source_cn":"一个喝醉的渔民说的，说雾气里有尖声怪叫，鬼影幢幢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC90E4D21DFBE5EDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241131011:1":{"text":"他声称撞见幽灵，然后就疯了，因此很多人都相信他说的。","source_cn":"他声称撞见幽灵，然后就疯了，因此很多人都相信他说的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0715C92BBF5ECA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1241131011":{"text":"他声称撞见幽灵，然后就疯了，因此很多人都相信他说的。","source_cn":"他声称撞见幽灵，然后就疯了，因此很多人都相信他说的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0715C92BBF5ECA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241131012:1":{"text":"即使有，那些幽灵传出的讯息也应该是警示。","source_cn":"即使有，那些幽灵传出的讯息也应该是警示。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0169F3DD4A7E3593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241131013:1":{"text":"我想，他们应该是在警示：<style=\"highlight\">不要靠近这里，有危险，快跑！</style>","source_cn":"我想，他们应该是在警示：<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAA75A8643975928","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241131014:1":{"text":"借闹鬼的传闻，我放出消息，让普通居民尽量不要靠近这里。","source_cn":"借闹鬼的传闻，我放出消息，让普通居民尽量不要靠近这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0468C052278B5AEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1241131015:1":{"text":"不、不管碰到什么，骑士满满都会打倒它！","source_cn":"不、不管碰到什么，骑士满满都会打倒它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBBE7EB199FCC321","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241131016:1":{"text":"如果满满说这话的时候手不抖，就更有气势了哦！","source_cn":"如果满满说这话的时候手不抖，就更有气势了哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FA3D10AFE49B6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"那些鬼影……","source_cn":"那些鬼影……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3A2F288C6D2201F2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"那些鬼影……","female":"那些鬼影……","variant_male_record_index":"66558","variant_female_record_index":"66559","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:1:2":{"text":"真有鬼吗？","source_cn":"真有鬼吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAFA014814171576E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"真有鬼吗？","female":"真有鬼吗？","variant_male_record_index"